invariant: INV-14
file: tls.c
catches: unit
reason: tlsi_config_ok takes a PSK identity one byte past CH_TICKET_ID_MAX,
  the bound hello_build proves the ClientHello in ch_tls.tx holds, so a
  configuration ch_connect and ch_record_init accept can make a hello
  that does not fit. bin/unit requires CH_EINVAL and no send for an
  identity of CH_TICKET_ID_MAX + 1 bytes.

--- old
    return len >= 1 && len <= CH_TICKET_ID_MAX;
--- new
    return len >= 1 && len <= CH_TICKET_ID_MAX + 1;
